  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>안녕하세요^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>매번 눈팅하다 비교적 자료가 가뭄인 지구과학에</p><p>&#160;</p><p>가지고 있는 여러 자료를 공유해보려고 합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>먼저 엘니뇨, 라니냐 수업을 진행할 때</p><p>&#160;</p><p>수온, 기압, 강우량(강수량)을 포함한 필수 정보를</p><p>가벼운 공작활동을 통해 쉽게 이해할 수 있습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아쉬운 점은 컬러프린트여야 합니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/923d10ccb937bec7b20202a9496778817c1a7243\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/923d10ccb937bec7b20202a9496778817c1a7243\" data-origin-width=\"821\" data-origin-height=\"457\"></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/681cf5bdd1e6c45012323b06a94a37fddd8f8ed6\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"858\" style=\"width:33.16%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/681cf5bdd1e6c45012323b06a94a37fddd8f8ed6\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31884cb0c8af3b1af7794f0dc6583d4a42310b73\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"844\" style=\"width:33.71%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31884cb0c8af3b1af7794f0dc6583d4a42310b73\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31694b53c7913cf4fad709503af89909a25350b0\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"859\" style=\"width:33.13%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31694b53c7913cf4fad709503af89909a25350b0\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>파일 다운로드는 아래 링크에서 받으시면 됩니다 ^^</p><p><b><a href=\"https://www.noaa.gov/sites/default/files/2022-11/enso_wheel.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.noaa.gov/sites/default/files/2022-11/enso_wheel.pdf</a></b></p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
